## Main Feature Modules

### 1. Audio Data Management
- Support multiple audio formats (WAV, MP3, FLAC, OGG, etc.)
- Audio file import and batch loading
- Waveform visualization and audio playback
- Audio trimming and splitting

### 2. Feature Engineering
- **Time-domain features**: Waveform, energy, zero-crossing rate
- **Frequency-domain features**: FFT spectrum, power spectral density
- **Time-frequency features**: STFT, Mel spectrogram, MFCC
- Feature visualization comparison

### 3. Data Augmentation
- Time stretching/compression
- Pitch shifting
- Adding noise
- Time shifting

### 4. Model Building
- Visual drag-and-drop model construction
- Preset acoustic model templates (1D-CNN, 2D-CNN, LSTM, etc.)
- Custom layer parameter configuration

### 5. Training Monitoring
- Real-time Loss/Accuracy curves
- Training progress display
- Early stopping and learning rate scheduling

### 6. Model Evaluation
- Confusion matrix
- Classification report
- Audio prediction testing

